  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moms Dont Want Welfare - We Want WEALTHFAIR!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Did you know when a welfare mom works, she is immediately cut off, reduced, and or experiences increases in her life-sustaining benefits(i.e. healthcare, food, and housing)?  Uncle Sam will give her the world as long as she stays home and does nothing!  Then our media portrays these &quot;welfare moms&quot; as lazy, apathetic leeches to the system!   MOMS DON&apos;T WANT WELFARE- THEY WANT WEALTHFAIR!    We have taken to the road in a beautifully wrapped RV with a message of hope and liberation for families.</narrative>
  </description>
